                </div>

                <h3>AI Factory Hub</h3>
                <p class="flagship-tagline">From raw content to published value – powered by AI</p>
                <p class="description">
                    A unified AI-powered platform orchestrating content creation, engineering automation,
                    and multi-platform publishing. Each module below is a full project on its own.
                </p>

                <div class="modules-grid">
                    <div class="module-chip">
                        <i class="fas fa-brain"></i>
                        <strong>AI Studio</strong>
                        <small>Image / video / audio analysis, enhancement & generation.</small>
