                    </div>
                    <div class="module-chip">
                        <i class="fas fa-microchip"></i>
                        <strong>Engineering Studio</strong>
                        <small>Electronics, PCB, CAD, robotics, embedded automation.</small>
                    </div>
                    <div class="module-chip">
                        <i class="fas fa-robot"></i>
                        <strong>Automation Studio</strong>
